# Milestone 2 (X1): the embedded terminal panel (21 §5.2) on the "rich" fixture, 1280x720, dark theme: the panel
# below the split with one terminal running `git status`, a second terminal tab, a taller panel, the light theme,
# the hidden panel and the Terminal settings page. `wait idle` after showing a terminal waits for the shell's
# prompt; `wait terminal shows` waits for a command's output (the end of it: the 240 dp panel shows the last rows).
resize 1280x720
set theme dark
open repository rich
wait idle
shot m2-terminal-01-hidden
show terminal
wait idle
terminal input git status
wait terminal shows Untracked files
assert terminal shows Untracked files
shot m2-terminal-02-panel
new terminal cmd
wait idle
shot m2-terminal-03-second-tab
select terminal 1
resize terminal 360
wait idle
shot m2-terminal-04-taller
set theme light
wait idle
shot m2-terminal-05-light
set theme dark
hide terminal
wait idle
shot m2-terminal-06-hidden-again
open settings page terminal
wait idle
shot m2-terminal-07-settings
close dialog
assert no error
